      "message": "From USB_PD_R2_0 V1.2 section 8.3.3.3.5\n\nIf there is no Explicit Contract and a Reject or Wait message is received, transition to PE_SNK_Wait_for_Capabilities.\n\nIf an Explicit Contract is in place and a Reject or Wait message is received, transition to PE_SNK_Ready.\n\nI\u0027ll add comments to make this clearer.",
